<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle prices quiet, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle prices quiet, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet early Wednesday, with no sales of slaughter steers or heifers reported on a live or dressed basis, according to USDA. Confirmed: None.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
